---
// Four-leaf clover, the family mark: four hearts with their tips to the centre (a 2x2 block, like a crosshair gap),
// one leaf in the accent colour (echoes the accent square used across the site) and a short stem.
// Leaves follow currentColor; the accent leaf follows the accent token, so it flips with the light theme.
// In the hero the leaves bloom in one by one (see .hero-in .rvb-mark .lf in global.css).
---
<svg class="rvb-mark" viewBox="16.7 9.2 66.6 77.7" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path class="stem" d="M50.00 60.20 C50.00 72.80 50.00 72.80 57.70 84.00" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4.76"/><g transform="translate(50 42) rotate(45) translate(0 -2.2)"><path class="lf" style="--i:3" d="M0 0 L-14 -14 A9.899 9.899 0 0 1 0 -28 A9.899 9.899 0 0 1 14 -14 Z" fill="var(--accent)"/></g><g transform="translate(50 42) rotate(135) translate(0 -2.2)"><path class="lf" style="--i:0" d="M0 0 L-14 -14 A9.899 9.899 0 0 1 0 -28 A9.899 9.899 0 0 1 14 -14 Z" fill="currentColor"/></g><g transform="translate(50 42) rotate(225) translate(0 -2.2)"><path class="lf" style="--i:1" d="M0 0 L-14 -14 A9.899 9.899 0 0 1 0 -28 A9.899 9.899 0 0 1 14 -14 Z" fill="currentColor"/></g><g transform="translate(50 42) rotate(315) translate(0 -2.2)"><path class="lf" style="--i:2" d="M0 0 L-14 -14 A9.899 9.899 0 0 1 0 -28 A9.899 9.899 0 0 1 14 -14 Z" fill="currentColor"/></g></svg>
